  <description>GPS to odometry conversion, odometry to TF broadcasting and LiDAR frame remapping (Politecnico di Milano Robotics, first project)</description>

  <maintainer email="alexandradumitrachee@gmail.com">Alexandra Dumitrache</maintainer>
  <author>lcard</author>
  <license>MIT</license>

